sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as API
  participant V as Validator
  participant E as Audit Engine
  participant S as Storage
  participant R as Report Generator

  UI->>API: Submit mapping and config
  API->>V: validate_project and validate_schema
  V->>S: write validation issues and hashes
  API->>E: evaluate Module A
  E->>E: paired metrics and bootstrap CI
  alt Module A does not pass
    E->>S: persist model-descriptive verdict
  else Module A passes
    API->>E: evaluate Module B
    alt Event claim requested and Module B passes
      API->>E: evaluate Module E
    end
    API->>E: evaluate optional Module D
    E->>S: persist module results and verdict
  end
  UI->>API: Request export
  API->>R: generate report from stored run
  R->>S: store export artifact

